# LoftedAero-SRX default parameters (the StabRX defaults are in LoftedAero-SRX-gyro)

# Onboard ExpressLRS receiver on SERIAL2 (CRSF; SERIAL2_PROTOCOL=23 comes from the hwdef)
# RSSI and link quality from CRSF link statistics
RSSI_TYPE 3
# keep the stock bit 5 (arming check throttle for 0 input, 32) and add bit 13 (420 kbaud ELRS link, 8192)
RC_OPTIONS 8224
